      "a vector index cannot be created on tables with security policies on the container but the same script works in Azure",
      "what will I have to redo when I move this local retrieval prototype into Azure",
      "my local model returns 768 numbers and the cloud model returns 1536, does that matter",
      "can I develop the whole retrieval loop on a laptop and switch to Azure later",
      "which parts of my local retrieval setup will not survive the move to the cloud"
    ],
    "routing": [
